(1. PURPOSE) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how release of finished goods is carried out at Northfield.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. SCOPE) Tj T*
(Applies to all release of finished goods activities in production and quality control at Northfield.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. RESPONSIBILITIES) Tj T*
(The process owner, Sami Ekwueme, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. PROCEDURE) Tj T*
(Step 1: Document the area is free of previous materials.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Escalate the result against the acceptance criterion, and record the result on form F-302.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Verify the second-person check.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Record the batch number.) Tj T*
(Step 5: Inspect the logbook entry.) Tj T*
(Step 6: Confirm the equipment status label.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. RECORDS) Tj T*
(Records of release of finished goods are kept for five years after batch expiry.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. REVISION HISTORY) Tj T*
(Revision   Change) Tj T*
(01         Revision 01: first issue.) Tj T*
(02         Revision 02: updated.) Tj T*
